{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53691","headline":"永嘉百咏 白鹤山 · 张又新","name":"永嘉百咏 白鹤山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白鹤山边秋复春，文君宅畔少风尘。\n欲驱五马寻真隐，谁是当年入竹人？\n（见永乐《乐清志》卷二、同治丙寅年刊齐召南纂《温州府志》卷四）（按：《全唐诗》卷四七九收本诗有缺误，今重录之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张又新","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}